   "widgets_values": [
    "A wide photograph of a small mountain weather station at first light, taken from a low ridge with a 35mm lens. A white instrument hut with slatted sides stands on four steel legs in the left third of the frame, with a cup anemometer and a wind vane on a mast above it and a row of three rain gauges on a concrete pad beside it. Frost covers the short grass and the roof of the hut. Behind the station a valley fills with low cloud, and a line of snow-covered peaks catches warm orange light under a pale blue sky. A hand-painted wooden sign by the path reads \"STATION 7\" in black capitals. Sharp detail, natural color, long soft shadows."
   ]
